+## Periodic transactions
+
+A periodic transaction starts with `~` in column one, a period, `from`, a
+start date, and an optional description:
+
+```text
+~ monthly from 2026-01-31 Rent
+    Expenses:Rent      1200.00
+    Assets:Checking
+```
+
+The period is `weekly`, `monthly` or `yearly`. The postings follow the same
+rules as a transaction's. Periodic transactions are not part of `balance`,
+`register` or `print`; `forecast --until DATE` turns each into dated
+transactions from its start date through DATE. Monthly and yearly
+occurrences keep the start day, falling on the last day of a shorter month
+(Jan 31, Feb 28, Mar 31). Without a description the generated payee is
+`Forecast`.
+
